      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebika by'oruganda rwa Yuda okwo byagabiirwe ensi bikagenda biti: Ensi yabo yagobaga rubaju orwa kasi aha rubibi rwa Edomu n'aha Irungu lya Sinai mukono ogwa kasi harai muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi orubibi rwabo rwa kasi rwayemaga aha nshonda y'Enyanja y'Omwonyu, ruruga n'aha kyasha ekyolekeire kasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rugendelera kugya kasi aha butemba bwa Akirabimu, ruraba Zini, rutemba kasi ya Kadeshibarinea, rugoba bwatana Hezironi, rwinugukira Adari rwezinga rugiire Karika; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ruraba Azimoni, rushohora aha Kaiga ka Misiri, rulekelera aha nyanja. Orwo nirwo rwabaga rubibi rwa Yuda orwa kasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orubibi orw'oburugaizoba rukaba ruli Nyanja y'Omwonyu kugoba aha munwa gwa Yorudani. Orubibi rubaju orwa bikara rwayemaga aha kyasha ky'enyanja aha munwa gwa Yorudani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rutemba rugoba Betihogila, ruraba rubaju orwa bikara orwa Betiaraba, rutemba rugoba aha Ibare lya Bohani mutabani wa Rubeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rutemba rugoba Debiri rwemire omu Ruhanga rwa Akori. Kityo aha rubaju rwa bikara rwolekera Giligali, elebangaine n'obutemba bwa Adumimu ekigo ekili rubaju orwa kasi rw'oruhanga. Orubibi orwo niruraba aha maizi ga Enishemeshi, n'aha ndekelero ni Enirogeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho rutemba rurabire aha ruhanga rwa mutabani wa Hinomu, kasi omu ndakwakwa y'Omuyebusi orubaju rwa bumosho niyo Yerusalemu; rutembera aha katwetwe k'eibanga elyolekeraine n'Oruhanga rwa Hinomu obugwaizoba, rugoba na bikara aha ndekelero y'Oruhanga rw'Abarefai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho orubibi rwema aha katwetwe k'eibanga, rugoba aha Nchuro za Nefutoa, rushuba rugoba ebigo by'Eibanga lya Efuroni, aho rugendera kimoi Baala niyo Kiriatiyearimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orubibi ruzingora obugwaizoba bwa Baala rugoba Eibanga lya Seiri, rugendera kimoi bikara bwatana Eibanga lya Yearimu niyo Kesaloni. Rusoka rugiire Betishemeshi, niruraba bwatana Timuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rutandikira omu ndakwakwa y'eibanga rubaju orwa bikara rwa Ekironi; aho rugoba Shikuroni, rukwata aha Ibanga lya Baala, ruturukira Yabuneeli, rushuba rugoba aha mwaro gw'enyanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orubibi rw'orubaju orw'obugwaizoba rukaba ruli Nyanja Empango n'omwegego gwayo. Egyo niyo nsi y'oruganda rwa Yuda nk'okwo amahiga garwo gali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'okwo Omukama yabaire ahangiire Musa, ekichweka ky'ensi y'oruganda rwa Yuda Yoshua akakiha Kalebu eya Yefune. Kalebu atwara Kiriatiaraba niyo Heburoni, Araba hakaba ali ishe Anaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalebu abingamu batabani ba Anaki bonshatu, nibo Sheshai, Ahimani na Tamari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aruga Heburoni atabalira abanyansi ba Debiri. Debiri eirai yayetwaga Kiriatiseferi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalebu agamba ati, “Alitera Kiriatiseferi akagisinga ndimusiigira Akisa muhara wange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otinieli mutabani wa Kenazi murumuna Kalebu wenene agikwata, aho amusiigira omuhara Akisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi ogu kayagobire omwa iba, agambira Otinieli kushaba Kalebu ensi. Aksa akuburuguka endogobeye; Kalebu amubaza ati, “Noyendaki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akisa ahorora ishe ati, “Ompe omugisha aha rw'okuba ompaire ensi ya kasi, ompe n'enchuro z'amaizi.” Kalebu amuha enchuro za bugyaruguru n'eza bugyaifo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu nibwo busika bw'oruganda rwa Yuda nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigo ebyabaire bili by'oruganda rwa Yuda, rubaju orwa kasi bwolekera orubibi rwa Edomu ni Kauzeeli, Ederi, Yaguri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kina, Dimona na Adada; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadeshi, Hazori na Itinani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zifu, Telemu na Baaloti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazorihadati na Kiriotihezironi nikyo Hazori; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amamu, Shema na Molada; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasarigada, Heshimoni na Betipeleti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasarishuali, Beerisheba na Biziosia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baala, Iyimu na Esemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elitoladi, Kesili na Horima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zikilagi, Madimana na Senisana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lebaoti, Shilihimu, Aini na Rimoni. Ebigo byona bili makumi gabili na mwendai hamoi n'ebyaro byabyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
